If it's omurice, I make it pretty well.

00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:02.020
If you're okay with my way of cooking it...

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:13.360
<b>{Door 501 18:12} Sairenji {Did I even need to put this? lol}</b>

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:16.320
Where is your older sister?

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:18.110
She's at work today.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:19.110
I see.

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:28.370
<i>Was offering to teach him how to cook too audacious?</i>

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:30.270
<i>B-But it's okay, right?</i>

00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:32.700
<i>Yuuki-kun said okay to it, after all.</i>

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:33.870
<i>This is my chance!</i>

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:36.970
<i>I have to make an appeal so I don't lose to Lala-san!</i>

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:06.960
Sairenji, your appearance...

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:15.130
I'm going to start, so pay attention. {lit. I'm going to cook, so watch}

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.030
Sairenji...

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:35.690
Sairenji!

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:37.900
Yuuki-kun!?

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:38.960
Sairenji!

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:40.060
Y-Yuuki-kun!?

00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:41.290
Sairenji!

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:42.490
Sairenji!

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:42.490
Yuuki-kun!

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:43.860
S-Sairenji!

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:45.160
Yuuki-kun!

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:45.520
Sai-

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:46.580
Yuuki-kun!

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:46.580
Sairenji!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.840
<i>What the heck am I thinking!?</i>

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:52.500
<i>That's the wrong kind of effort!</i>

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:55.310
Um... Sairenji, what's wrong?

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:56.550
Y-Yes!

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:58.210
O-Okay, we'll get started. {j-ja, hajimeru kara}

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:00.140
If there's anything you don't understand, ask me, okay? {wakannai tokoro attara kiite ne}

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:02.510
Y-Yeah. Please take care of me.

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:07.900
Eh, you're really good at this.

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:09.820
A-Am I?

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:16.050
I've had an interest in cooking ever since I was little...

00:20:16.050 --> 00:20:18.710
So about the time I was in elementary school,

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:21.160
I asked my parents to go to cooking class.

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:24.670
I even thought about joining the cooking club.

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:25.830
Is that so?

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:27.730
Then why did you join the tennis club?

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:31.160
That's because of your influence, Yuuki-kun.

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:35.250
I{...} was always poor at physical activities.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.670
Well, I'm not very good at it now, either.

00:20:38.390 --> 00:20:40.630
But during middle school,

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:45.180
I always saw you participating in athletic festivals and the like and thought...

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:50.680
"I want to be like that, too. If I could be like that..."

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:53.350
Like me...?

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:55.840
Ah!

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:58.060
Next, cut the chicken into little pieces.

00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:00.430
Yuuki-kun, would you please hand me the chicken?

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:02.210
Yeah, got it.

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:06.310
Oh!

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:07.320
Amazing!

00:21:08.150 --> 00:21:09.570
Thanks for the meal!

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:10.580
Enjoy.

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:16.660
Mmm! Delicious!

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:19.470
This is really tasty, Sairenji!

00:21:19.470 --> 00:21:20.940
Glad to hear that.

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:23.300
As I expected!

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:26.040
<i>I'm so happy!</i>

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:28.850
<i>He's that delighted by my cooking!</i>

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:31.800
<i>Should I try saying it...?</i>

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:35.850
<i>"If you like my cooking, I'll make it for you any time you want."</i>

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:45.620
U-Uh, umm...

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:52.420
Maron!?

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:53.210
Celine!?

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:54.080
What are you doing!?

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:57.790
Hey! Don’t run around!

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:02.050
Why are you hiding there, Maron!?

00:22:03.280 --> 00:22:04.550
Stop it, Maron!

00:22:15.090 --> 00:22:17.210
W-Wait...

00:22:34.450 --> 00:22:36.120
N-No...

00:22:38.570 --> 00:22:39.570
No!

00:22:42.810 --> 00:22:43.880
No...

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:52.980
Don't look... Yuuki-kun!

00:22:57.350 --> 00:22:59.850
Hey, stop it!

00:23:00.390 --> 00:23:03.140
I didn't see anything, I didn't see anything! {mitenaide, mitenaide}

00:23:03.140 --> 00:23:04.790
Celine, let go!

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:06.480
I said, let go!

00:23:09.180 --> 00:23:14.740
So, this is the omurice you learned to cook from Haruna-san...?

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:18.540
Did you really make it the way she taught you to?

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:20.020
Well, um...

00:23:20.020 --> 00:23:23.330
Some things happened, and my mind went blank.

00:23:27.280 --> 00:23:28.340
Thanks for the meal.

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:33.520
You don't have to force yourself to eat it!

00:23:35.690 --> 00:23:36.810
Gross.

00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:39.560
Although I do like it half-cooked.

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:42.560
But... {demo, maa}

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:48.040
I appreciate the gesture. {lit. I get your feelings}

00:23:50.100 --> 00:23:50.900
Huh?

00:23:51.480 --> 00:23:53.260
Haruna, your face is red.

00:23:53.260 --> 00:23:54.700
Did something happen?

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:56.410
N-No, nothing.

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:58.410
{end}
